+/**
+ * With a display aspect set: perspective projections with these aspects (width / height) were
+ * already widened by the game for the wider target, like those at the logical aspect times the
+ * widening, and are shown as they are (e.g. a cinematic camera's 2.105 inside a full frame,
+ * widened to 2.105 times the widening). At most 8; replaces the previous list.
+ */
+void AuroraSetWidenedAspects(const float* aspects, u32 count);
+
 /**
